[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 122.59, "timestamp": "00:02:02", "text": "我。幫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 130.949, "timestamp": "00:02:10", "text": "趕緊滾到橋邊去。我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 133.22899999999998, "timestamp": "00:02:13", "text": "還有救。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 140.949, "timestamp": "00:02:20", "text": "堅持，稍等。我們需要繼續前進。好的。  是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 161.19, "timestamp": "00:02:41", "text": "這些卡住了嗎？只是吃東西而已。  吃東西就像吃垃圾食物一樣。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 163.11, "timestamp": "00:02:43", "text": "找"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 164.869, "timestamp": "00:02:44", "text": "另一條路去橋上。我們時間不多了。我有一點要說。"}]